31 ; 22:16 ; 28:3 ; Eccl 4:1 ; also with accusative of congnate meaning with verb ׳ע גָּזֵל (וְ)גָזַל עשֶׁק Ezek 18:18 practise extortion , 22:29 , take by extortion Leviticus 5:23 and (with accusative of thing) Mal 3:5 ; absolute Hosea 12:8 practise extortion ; Job 10:3 deal tyrannically (of God); participle oppressor, extortioner Jer 21:12 ; Psa 72:4 ; Eccl 4:1 ; passive participle as substantive the oppressed Psa 103:6 ; 146:7 . 2 oppress a nation Isa 52:4 , compare Psa 105:14 = 1Chr 16:21 ; Psa 119:122 , participle act. oppressor 119:121 , passive participle oppressed Jer 50:33 , in predict. ׳ע וְגָזוּל Deut 28:29 , ׳ע וְרָצּוּץ 28:23 ; Hosea 5:11 . 3 dubious are: נָהָר יַעְשֹׁק Job 40:23 a river oppresses him, i.e. rushes violently upon him (that is, the hippopotamus; Du יָשֹׁק , from שׁוּק ; &gt; Gunk Bu יִשְׁקַע falls, sinks ); נֶפֶשׁ בְּדַם עָשֻׁק Prov 28:17 oppressed (? burdened) with the blood of a person. Pu`al Participle feminine הַמְּעֻשָּׁקָה Isa 23:12 crushed (of conquered Sidon under figure of woman).","rootNote":"a primitive root (compare 6229 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 21","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 21","1Sam 12 3","1Sam 12 4","Amos 4 1","Deut 24 14","Deut 28 29","Deut 28 33","Eccl 4 1"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/עָשְׁקָ֔/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Sam 12 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":12,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עָשַׁ֨קְתִּי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp1cs"},{"reference":"1Sam 12 4","book":"1Sam","chapter":12,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֲשַׁקְתָּ֖/נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp2ms/Sp1cp"},{"reference":"Amos 4 1","book":"Amos","chapter":4,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֹשְׁק֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Vqrfpa"},{"re